        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "id": "step-2",
      "heading": "Brown the mince",
      "blocks": [
        "Heat a drizzle of vegetable oil in a wide frying pan over high heat. Add the beef mince and shallot and fry for 4 minutes, breaking up the mince as it browns."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Brown the beef",
          "seconds": [
            240
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "crispy-chilli-beef-coriander-noodles-2-sketch",
